# because the device-side array is the compilers.
#
# Mechanical, and it will be overwritten the next time the file is regenerated.
# It is edited rather than left to rot because `precompile` EVALUATES these type
# expressions at load: a stale `Lava.LavaArray` is an `UndefVarError`, not a
# silently skipped statement.
