# `LavaBackend` was ever covered and it got re-inferred every session --
# measured at ~29 s of Julia inference for a 16x16 scene, 22 s of it in ten
# signatures.
#
# `precompile` only infers, it never runs the call, so nothing here touches a
# Vulkan device. That is the same property Lava's own workload relies on and
# is what makes this work on a machine with no GPU.
